/*!
@defgroup iomuxc_driver IOMUXC: IOMUX Controller

@details IOMUXC driver provides APIs for pin configuration. It also supports the
miscellaneous functions integrated in IOMUXC.

The IOMUXC driver supports:
  - Per-pin function-ID tuples (`mux register`, `mux mode`, `input register`,
    `input daisy`, `config register`) covering all multiplexed pin alternates
  - APIs to set the pin mux, the input daisy chain, and the pin pad
    configuration in a single call

*/
